 position.\nUniversity Budget Funds \u2013 students should apply directly to the campus office. Attaching a personal resume\u2019\nis recommended and the position may require a personal interview.\nGraduate Assistant\nResearch or Teaching Assistantships are awarded on a competitive basis. Funding may\nbe from internal (budget) or external sources (grants, etc.) and continuation of the\nposition is dependent on the availability of funds. Graduate students must abide by\nassistantship policies and procedures to retain eligibility. Maintaining good academic\nstanding is necessary. It is the student\u2019s responsibility to become familiar with\nthe Graduate Assistantship Guidelines.\nQuicklinks\nApply\nLibrary\nBookstore\nDirectory\nNews\nWorkday\nContact\nReport an Incident\nCampus Safety Statistics\n201 Mayfield Ave, Ruston, LA 71272\n318.257.2000\nApplyRequest InfoGive\nDepartment of Testing & Disability Services\nPrivacy Statement\nEEO Statement\nTitle IX/Power-Based Violence\nAccessibility\nSuicide & Crisis Lifeline: Call or text 988.\nCopyright \u00a9 2026\nWebpage problems? Contact web@latech.edu\nMember of the University of Louisiana System\nModernCampus Quicklink\nModernCampus Quicklink", "links": [["Skip To Top Navigation", "https://www.latech.edu/admissions/graduate/finanacial-assistance.php#skipToTopNav"], ["Skip To Content", "https://www.latech.edu/admissions/graduate/finanacial-assistance.php#skipToContent"], ["Skip To Footer", "https://www.latech.edu/admissions/graduate/finanacial-assistance.php#skipToFooter"], ["", "https://www.latech.edu/"], ["Current Students", "https://www.latech.edu/student-life/index.php"], ["Future Students", "https://www.latech.edu/admissions/"], ["Faculty & Staff", "https://www.latech.edu/faculty-staff/"], ["Alumni", "https://www.latech.edu/alumni/index.php"], ["The Kennel", "https://experience.latech.edu/portal/application"], ["Apply", "https://www.latech.edu/admissions/apply/index.php"], ["Request Info", "https://experience.la